   - Go to the "Shape" tab and click on "Rectangle".
   - Set the width and height to 500 pixels each.

2. **Open the Path Property**:
   - Click on the stopwatch icon next to the "Path" property to enable keyframing (if not already enabled).
   - Right-click on the "Path" property and select "Edit as Text".

3. **Write the Expression**:
   - Replace the existing text with the following expression:

```javascript
// Define the size of the square
var size = [500, 500];

// Define the radius for rounding corners
var radius = 20; // Adjust this value to change the roundness

// Create the path array
var path = [];

// Top-left point
path.push([0, 0]);

// Top-right point (rounded)
