Here's an example of how you might write such constraints:

```systemverilog
module top;
    reg [31:0] data;

    // Constraint to ensure there are exactly 5 transitions
    constraint c_transitions {
        int trans_count = $countones(data ^ {data[31], data});
        trans_count == 5;
    }

    initial begin
        // Example usage: Generate random numbers and check the constraint
        repeat(10) begin
            data = $urandom();
            if (!c_transitions.randomize()) begin
                $display("Failed to find a valid value");
            end else begin
                $display("Valid value found: %b", data);
            end
        end
    end
endmodule
```

